{"id":"22.01.Playgendary","contentHtml":"<p>My path at Playgendary is a story of <strong>explosive growth in 10 months</strong>: from Unity Developer to a specialist trusted with the <strong>role of <code>Technical Owner</code></strong> on flagship AAA projects and <strong>founding new games from scratch</strong>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Responsibilities and Achievements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Led Development on AAA Project <em>Home Design</em>:</strong> Took technical ownership of the project, conducted reverse engineering, and led a new team.</li>\n<li><strong>Acted as \"Founder\" of New Projects:</strong> Started game development from scratch paired with a PM, laying down the architecture as a <code>Technical Owner</code> and continuing to curate them after team expansion.</li>\n<li><strong>Acted as R&#x26;D Engineer:</strong> <mark>Proactively researched and prototyped complex mechanics</mark>.</li>\n<li><strong>Solved Complex Rendering Tasks:</strong> Besides gameplay, engaged in writing and optimizing <strong>shaders</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Mentored the Team:</strong> Helped other developers, conducted code reviews, and shared expertise, especially in optimization and architecture matters.</li>\n<li><strong>Work under NDA:</strong> <mark>Most games I worked on are under NDA and cannot be shown publicly.</mark></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Challenge</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>The main challenge</strong> was to <strong>lead and restart development</strong> on the AAA project <em>Home Design</em>, knowledge about the architecture of which was practically lost. <strong>I conducted</strong> deep reverse engineering of the codebase, <strong>formed and led</strong> a new team, establishing a stable process for delivering critical features.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Legacy and Growth</h2>\n<p>Work at Playgendary became a catalyst for my growth to the <strong>level of lead and role of <code>Technical Owner</code></strong>. I learned to take responsibility for products and teams, effectively communicate with management, and mentor colleagues. This experience proved that my <strong>quality engineering implementation directly affects the final result</strong> - be it product stability or the successful launch of new monetization features.</p>\n","published":true,"title":"Playgendary","date":"2022-01 - 2023-03","type":"experience","tagsArray":["Mobile","Unity","C#","HLSL","Addressables","DOTween","Firebase (Analytics, Crashlytics, Config, Messaging)","VFX","UniTask","Odin Inspector"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>My path at Playgendary: within 9 months, grew from a developer to a specialist trusted with the <strong>Technical Owner role</strong> on AAA hits and the foundation of new projects.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://www.playgendary.com","https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4614678246860437532","https://apps.apple.com/iq/developer/playgendary-limited/id1487320337"],"role":"unity-dev","projectIcon":"/images/projects/22.01.Playgendary/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/22.01.Playgendary/card.webp","screenshots":[]}